{"product_id":"iqos-terea-berrine-edition","title":"IQOS Terea Berrine Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eTerea Cigarette Berrine Edition -Cooling and floral tobacco sensation with Indonesian cloves. A blend of fine tobacco with Indonesian cloves and refreshing cooling menthol enriched with fruity and floral aromas.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that IQOS ILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41763726131255,"sku":"Terea Berrine Edition - Pack","price":900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41763726164023,"sku":"Terea Berrine Edition - Carton","price":7500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos_terea_stick_berrine_edition_cigarette.webp?v=1751932813","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-terea-berrine-edition","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




